/**
 * @file
 * @brief AspectFill
 * A VDMX Plugin that fills any aspect ratio canvas with a blurred background of the source image.
 *
 * | Published Input | Type | Notes |
 * |---|---|---|
 * | Image | VuoImage | VDMX source (video or still) |
 * | StillImageMode | VuoBoolean | turn ON for still images (R↔B swap) |
 * | Width / Height | VuoInteger | driven by VDMX Size field |
 * | BlurRadius | VuoReal (0..200) | background blur radius in points |
 *
 * Output: `OutputImage` (VuoImage, Width × Height).
 *
 * Install path: `~/Library/Application Support/VDMX/plugins/`
 *
 * @author [9c5s](https://vuo.org/user/2746870)
 * @version 1.0
 * @lastSavedInVuoVersion 2.4.6
 * @copyright Copyright © 2026 [9c5s](https://vuo.org/user/2746870)
 * @license This composition may be modified and distributed under the terms of the MIT License. For more information, see https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT .
 * @see This is a Vuo Composition source code file.  See https://vuo.org for further information.
 */

